      "text": "Benefits:\n✓ Fault tolerance\n✓ Retry logic\n✓ Priority queues\n✓ Dead letter queue\n✓ Rate limiting\n✓ Backpressure\n✓ Horizontal scaling\n\nGuarantees:\n• At-least-once\n• Message persistence\n• ACK/NACK",
