      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762291961302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Scaling:\n• 5-50 workers\n• Auto-scale by queue\n• Worker per task type\n• Prefetch: 4 tasks\n• Concurrency: 4\n\nReliability:\n• Retry (3x exponential)\n• Timeout: 30 min\n• Heartbeat\n• Task revoke\n• Idempotent tasks\n\nMonitoring:\n• Flower dashboard\n• Task latency",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scaling:\n• 5-50 workers\n• Auto-scale by queue\n• Worker per task type\n• Prefetch: 4 tasks\n• Concurrency: 4\n\nReliability:\n• Retry (3x exponential)\n• Timeout: 30 min\n• Heartbeat\n• Task revoke\n• Idempotent tasks\n\nMonitoring:\n• Flower dashboard\n• Task latency",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ah",
      "autoResize": true
    },
