      "updated": 1762291901783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Architecture:\n  • AI Orchestrator (central LLM manager)\n  • Multi-provider: GPT-4 → Claude → Llama\n  • Prompt versioning & A/B testing\n  • Response caching (Redis)\n  • LangChain/LlamaIndex for RAG\n  • Vector DB (Pinecone) for job matching\n  • Cost tracking: ~$0.15 per candidate\n  • 🎯 GenAI Use Cases: Scoring, feedback,\n    job matching, practice coaching,\n    bias detection, emotion analysis",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Architecture:\n  • AI Orchestrator (central LLM manager)\n  • Multi-provider: GPT-4 → Claude → Llama\n  • Prompt versioning & A/B testing\n  • Response caching (Redis)\n  • LangChain/LlamaIndex for RAG\n  • Vector DB (Pinecone) for job matching\n  • Cost tracking: ~$0.15 per candidate\n  • 🎯 GenAI Use Cases: Scoring, feedback,\n    job matching, practice coaching,\n    bias detection, emotion analysis",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "as",
      "autoResize": true
    },
