      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tech:\n  • React 19\n  • Next.js 16\n  • TanStack Query\n  • Zustand (state)\n  • WebSocket client\n  • MediaRecorder API\n  • IndexedDB (offline)",
      "fontSize": 16.114285714285707,
