    {
      "id": "f8J0nb63kF-A2_G7GXiZS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1247.1428571428573,
      "y": 907.0000000000002,
      "width": 570.89599609375,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0BV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1424614378,
      "version": 195,
      "versionNonce": 617642154,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1762292194271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " PostgreSQL Architecture:\n  • Primary Database (write operations)\n  • Read Replicas (2-3 instances for read scaling)\n  • Connection Pooling (PgBouncer) - 100 connections\n  • Replication: Streaming replication (async)\n\n  Data Flow:\n  • Writes → Primary DB (strong consistency)\n  • Reads → Read Replicas (eventual consistency, ~100ms lag)\n  • Cache Layer → Redis (sessions, hot data, leaderboards)\n  • Full-text Search → PostgreSQL JSONB + GIN indexes\n  • Vector Search → Pinecone/pgvector (embeddings for job matching)\n\n  Consistency Model:\n  • User Auth: Strong consistency (read from primary)\n  • Analytics: Eventual consistency (read from replicas)\n  • Candidate Scores: Read-after-write consistency (wait for replication)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "WcZE18WWXT3JPiRRP4Okf",
      "originalText": " PostgreSQL Architecture:\n  • Primary Database (write operations)\n  • Read Replicas (2-3 instances for read scaling)\n  • Connection Pooling (PgBouncer) - 100 connections\n  • Replication: Streaming replication (async)\n\n  Data Flow:\n  • Writes → Primary DB (strong consistency)\n  • Reads → Read Replicas (eventual consistency, ~100ms lag)\n  • Cache Layer → Redis (sessions, hot data, leaderboards)\n  • Full-text Search → PostgreSQL JSONB + GIN indexes\n  • Vector Search → Pinecone/pgvector (embeddings for job matching)\n\n  Consistency Model:\n  • User Auth: Strong consistency (read from primary)\n  • Analytics: Eventual consistency (read from replicas)\n  • Candidate Scores: Read-after-write consistency (wait for replication)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
